# BuildKit does NOT match nested directories with a bare `node_modules`/`dist`
# pattern — it would leak host node_modules / stale build output into the build
# context. Use `**/` so every workspace's copy is excluded (Bun-1.3 gotcha).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.expo
**/coverage
# Any workspace's local env file, not only the root one: `COPY packages/backend`
# would otherwise carry packages/backend/.env into a builder layer, and the
# deploy exports builder layers to the Actions cache (mode=max). No build step
# reads a .env.example, so those stay out too.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude
docs
**/*.test.ts
**/__tests__
